Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attained every treasure\Nthat the world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smiling, even as he stood upon the scaffold,\Nhe issued a challenge to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now those who dare to dream hoist their\Nflags and sail into the great pirate era.
