Dialogue: 3,0:01:53.23,0:01:57.43,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(1485,0)}To the Deep Sea
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.23,0:01:57.43,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(1485,0)\t(1451,1485,\1a&H00&)}To the Deep Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's too hard to dig here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.53,0:02:01.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(755,522)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(721,755,\1a&H00&)\t(3458,3491,\1a&HFF&)}Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.53,0:02:01.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(755,522)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island is all rocks and tree roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't bury us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're victims too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me live. Captain Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made us do this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I have a secret to share with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't give a damn about going\Nto the new world with the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason we joined
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was so we could stab them\Nin the back and collect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their bounties without them\Never suspecting a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I won't let my friend die! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your Straw Hat did look a little off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it had been two years,\Nso I didn't think much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lied without remorse, and deception\Nis a sin, one that you will be buried for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, how goes the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm digging! I'm digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinners all, these poor fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gods in heaven, please forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grant them peace and death. Yes! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace, yes, but not death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, it's not all bad, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did find the real Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you there wasn't\Nany choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.23,0:03:39.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(853,521)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(819,853,\1a&H00&)\t(3789,3822,\1a&HFF&)}Fake Straw Hats Gathering Point
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.23,0:03:39.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(853,521)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Fake Straw Hats Gathering Point
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's as strong as Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with the pacifistas, we\Ncouldn't so much as slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the Caribou Brothers\Nescaped along with the rest of their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems they took some of the\Nfake Straw Hats with them as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we captured\Nmost of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though the real Straw Hats\Nheavily damaged two of our pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the units was the same\Nprototype they fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its strength hasn't changed\Nin the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bad news. For us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they've been up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Straw Hats are immeasurably\Nmore dangerous than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the Marines in the New World that\Nthey have a new threat coming their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have returned, and they're\Nstronger than we could have imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pity they had to take off so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm proud of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna do just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a big fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that smile, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.98,0:05:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a nice ship you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but it's not exactly mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather, I stole it after\Nmy house burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's destiny meeting you, I say. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we team up and turn\Nthis whole world upside down? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought I drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are or what\Nyou're selling, but I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before then, I never\Nbelieved much in fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe nothing really\Nhappens by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just too blind to see all the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that hat found the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as it sails,\NI'll stay here, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I want to see a\Nnew king before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The surface is already so far away.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.77,0:05:58.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(518,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(485,518,\1a&H00&)}Beneath the Seas of the Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.77,0:05:58.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)\fad(518,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\fnKakumin Web\4a&HFF&}Beneath the Seas of the Sabaody Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been under before, but\Nportholes on a submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got nothing on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sinking! Sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we get a leak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it feels like we're\Nleaving the whole world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's eerie. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done this like a\Nbajillion times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not pooping my pants at all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean sure is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really are trees, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I totally forgot about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're giant mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell when you're up top,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's sure quite a sight\Nto see from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The majesty of nature is truly humbling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, my eyes would be\Npopping out of my skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had any eyes to speak of, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares? I've seen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you got on the\Nwrong ship! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These roots, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They stretch all the way down\Nto the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, I think there's\Nsomething behind that tree. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took us long enough to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whatever, it was worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, fishies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I didn't grab them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These look pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you put that bubble and we all\Ndie, I'm gonna kill you! Twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you know how the\Ncoding works, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we get some basic tips before\Nanother idiot flips out on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:08:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point, okay Rayleigh gave me\Na manual, but I can summarize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So listen closely, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can die happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's flipping out now, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His nosebleed shot out! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It maintains its shape well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think that it would burst,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially considering\Nthe immense amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water pressure the coating\Nmust be exposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.42,0:08:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought we'd all drown down\Nhere, never to be seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bright seawater, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, gee, what the heck\Nhappened to you back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were weak to pretty\Ngirls, but this is a real liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine the horrors he must\Nhave endured during the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he lives long enough to see\Nthe mermaids he was so looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and let's also hope they aren't quite so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lovely that the sight of\Nthem strikes him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get there, we'll have\Nto ask for blood donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they won't be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope fishmen have the\Nsame kind of blood as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunny's coating has the same\Nproperties as the bubbles on Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meaning that objects or people can pass in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and out without causing\Nit any harm at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare me the bubble science!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a man down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji aside, she's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw this all over Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only stretches so far, then\Nallows an object to pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the good news is if we get\Nattacked by any nasty sea creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still fire cannons at them just\Nlike we would if we were above water!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so what would pop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it that durable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does fine with single objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if too many things pass\Nthrough at once then it'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, like if a sea king clamps down\Non the ship, for example, that's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also the coating doesn't protect the\Nship from anything except water so if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we crash into a rock or a trench and\Nthe mast breaks or something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the bubble could also burst so\Nit's not like we can just bounce around
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down here still as long as we take the\Nusual precautions we should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean I'm sure Luffy will try to get\Nus all killed but what else is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're in clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in theory at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a lot of ships try\Nto make the trip to Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man Island and over 70\Npercent of them sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are so dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Gum-Gum gatling and I bet I can\Ncatch all the fish swimming out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if I cut enough holes in this bubble\Nthing I bet I could catch even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you listening to Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too many holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our chances down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are bad enough as it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, break your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fix them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's break them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haji said he'd show us the Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it was no big deal, And now\Nwe're stuck in this death bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slowly descending to our demise! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lunch time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They packed a bunch of food for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji's sick, we should\Nhave ourselves a Pikmin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that screaming made me hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'm wasting away! Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Nami thinks\Nthe ship will stay stable,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to steer it or\Nanything right now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just be cruising on the sea\Ncurrent till we get further down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll have more\Nexcitement a bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the time being, we might as\Nwell just kick back and take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't call this\Ntaking it easy, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's something you guys should\Nprobably know before we reach Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so much surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got all kinds of secrets, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you transform into a tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got laser guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us, Robo-Pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super-armored! Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no new secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.16,0:12:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secrets inaccessible. Robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He speaks robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, I know robots are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or eat and listen, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Usopp said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hachi was supposed to show us the\Nway to Fishman Island himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he got hurt real bad back on Sabo Odi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came down here ahead of\Nus to get medical treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it was the same\Nthing that happened to Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning, he was protecting the\NSunny from anyone who came for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things got ugly about a year ago when the\NNavy found out the ship was docked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both him and Duval got\Ntaken out in a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:12:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then who was protecting\Nthe Sunny after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had one more secret ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not really, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who separated us two\Nyears ago, for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Warlord. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out Bartholomew Kuma was\Non our side the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I made it to the Sunny,\NI couldn't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw for yourself, there wasn't\Na single scratch on the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, Rayleigh gave me the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a member of the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's within my power, I want to\Nhelp the Straw Hats escape from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys probably knew that something\Nwas up, but now we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved the Sunny,\Nand he saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, after we were\Nsent flying from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma paid Rayleigh a visit\Nand dropped another bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details are a little\Nsketchy, But evidently,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma surrendered his body to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They used him as an experiment and\Nreplaced his body parts one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time the War of\Nthe Best rolled around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his personality had been\Ncompletely erased. Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he knew where he sent us, but he didn't\Nknow what we'd do once we got there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that we would even make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you said his personality was taken\Naway, but he still protected the Sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:15:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy who worked on him is\Nthis dude named Dr. Vegapunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kuma must have made\Na deal with him because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he programmed one final\Nmission into his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend the Thousand Sunny\Nfrom any attackers until
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moment that a Straw\NHat returns to claim it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So even though he's been reduced\Nto a living weapon with no memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's been carrying out his own orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protecting our ship for the past\Ntwo years to fulfill his last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely knew us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why'd it matter\Nto him? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's cause of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said Kuma was part of\Nthe Revolutionary Army,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Luffy's dad was the\Nleader of those guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems like that robot\Nbear dude was a good guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he can't be too bad if they're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bottom line is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our survival and all the things we\Naccomplished in the past two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we owe to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever his reason was,\Nwe should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we may never find out the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because it's not like we can ask\Nhim to explain himself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all we can do now is\Nhonor his memory and know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that Bartholomew Kuma\Nwas our greatest ally
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until he took his last breath as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we'll\Nnever be able to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him since he'll just be a weapon and\Nlikely our enemy the next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of a lot to work through\Nall at once, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can at least find\Nout the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma saved us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake. Good. Have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island with all the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course that's where he sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where I was\Nthese past two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm kind of thinking Kuma's\Nnot such a good friend after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, if he were here right now,\NI'd like to kick his metal face in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all had our share of troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I became a pop music\Nsensation, I was trapped in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, the only thing that matters\Nnow is the voyage awaiting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you said, they're straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be sailing\Nwith the Straw Hats after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, how far down are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's\Ngetting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We passed the photic zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it looks like we're around\Nthe bottom of the aphotic zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About a thousand meters, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quiet, and the sunny\Nitself feels oddly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like floating in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, what is that thing a fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only get one shot at this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you say anything, I\Nknow what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shoot them and they'll all drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're wanted dead or alive, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why not let them die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that would do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the Navy wouldn't\Nknow who killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to deliver their heads\Npersonally on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they will fear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world will do our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take them out before they suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My big smiling face is the last thing\Nthey'll see before they die! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, there's a ship-looking\Nthing coming our way. What? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come look for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pilot ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ramming straight into us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away, you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to make us all drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not trying to break our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're trying to board it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dummies, who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:18:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to board, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack them, CJ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, tenacious, aren't they? That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys after?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bubble's about to pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, sea cow! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they want to board the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that noise from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two bubbles are touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a big moment, brother! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've met before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from the Arlong Pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me? Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was at Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, doesn't that\Nthing look kind of familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dump-pump pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pay our new friends\Na visit, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that guy's up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he's looking for a fight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're completely dumbfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna sit there\Ncatching flies Then we'll strike
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the iron is hot, we'll\Nsmite this entire crew right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For glory
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come along, men. We'll\Nmake the beggars for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Skull? Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left Captain Tribe\Non the ship back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for a little greeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire the Gatling gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, shower them in bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want every last one of them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send these Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,THE HELL!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to throw\Nme into the water, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that to me, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.03,0:21:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a reasonable fellow, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're very good-looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone like you understands\Nthe value of human life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emphasize!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gods are watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:21:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be judged for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, make up your freaking mind already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just about to fire your Gatling\Ngun and blast us all to kingdom come?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just, uh, I was just joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're the captain of\Nthat ship, but what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world makes you\Nthink I would be the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those ruffians were keeping\Nme as a slave! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, ooh, glad that's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could stay on this nice\Nship with you all for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I feel kind of sorry\Nfor this poor loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's obviously lying! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that giant sea cow\Npulling your ship come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:22:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this vixen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the famous cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, watch it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed to drool over our\Nbeautiful navigator except for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.14,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're perfectly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.12,0:23:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just happened to catch it\Nout in the ocean somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.66,0:23:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having a sea monster pull your ship\Nis the mark of an experienced captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find a sea monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What crazy ideas are\Nyou hatching now, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should try to rehabilitate him\Nwith something a little less sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.15,0:23:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the direction we're taking isn't exactly\Nthe same way the Log Pose is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.02,0:23:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:24:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The correct course is technically\Nsouthwest, so we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if we went in a straight line,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could get there a whole\Nlot faster, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you go straight, you risk\Ngetting swept away in a sea current.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that should happen, you might run\Ninto an underwater mountain or a volcano,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.74,0:24:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.65,0:24:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.60,0:24:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I thought all the\Ncurrents here were dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the Grand Line, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you saying that some\Nof them are actually stable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.80,0:24:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you stay put. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna start getting\Ncolder from here on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so make sure you put\Non a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.46,0:24:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bring up a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already starting to\Nfeel goosebumps on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, except for I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.52,0:24:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have any skin\Nbecause you're a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, skull jokes are\Nthe only thing I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.86,0:24:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going somewhere\Ncold, not the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys know the\Nwater's cold in the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like a bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:25:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot water rises and cold\Nsinks to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.54,0:25:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.78,0:25:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take very many baths. Aha,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because heat rises and\Nthere's not much sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.80,0:25:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to\Nheat the water down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.14,0:25:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The temperature's not the only thing\Nthat's different at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not still depressed\Nare you once we move
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down we'll find something\Ncalled deep currents
