Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely independent of\Nwhat you see closer to the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surface currents under\Nthe currents and you even
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a diagram huh you\Nsure do know a lot of stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's because I'm so\Nold not only that but
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.28,0:25:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all currents are connected\Nto each other but
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.98,0:25:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean they have to flow in the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,same direction they flow\Neast west up and down
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.00,0:25:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's like a big long dragon all\Ntangled up the deep currents tend to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,travel at a surprisingly slow pace\Nafter they reach the deep sea it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.64,0:26:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,approximately 2 000 years before\Nthey finally make their way up to the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.26,0:26:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,surface of the water that makes me\Nfeel young again actually two thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.32,0:26:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.64,0:26:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are countless tales about what\Nlurks within those deep, dark currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.46,0:26:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wrath of the Undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.84,0:26:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the deep sea is haunted? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea's haunted? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.50,0:26:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds fun to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.48,0:26:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything\Nabout the wrath of the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,undead or whatever you're\Nfreaking out about,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do know that we'll encounter\Nor a downward-flowing current soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we do, we should be able to\Nride it down into the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said something\Nabout deep-sea currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.44,0:26:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.35,0:26:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You morons can at least\Npretend like you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.02,0:26:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we sing a duet, Nami? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.40,0:27:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's freaking sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit, whatever that thing\Nis, it's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's called the Downward Plume.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like a giant waterfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.92,0:27:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.20,0:27:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea is, like, falling into the sea,\NWhich doesn't make sense, but I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.98,0:27:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother Nature, you're one crazy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.56,0:27:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of it, I'd\Nsay the stream runs fairly deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.58,0:27:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard stories about these currents,\Nbut they do not do them justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy dark down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.98,0:27:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The floor so far you can't even see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.20,0:27:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.62,0:28:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this speed, we're going to get pile\Ndriven straight down to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.32,0:28:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's safe if\Nwe just go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about\Nthe ship, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunny was built from\Nthe treasure tree, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as tough as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone really does live down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.38,0:28:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A demon that rules over the deep seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy of all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.74,0:28:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die! Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what is the matter with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.18,0:28:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.98,0:28:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A legendary giant octopus monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.42,0:29:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made fish food out of those ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.38,0:29:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They left for the new\Nworld and never made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.32,0:29:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait around for a couple\Ndays and it'll probably go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a perfect idea! Yeah! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to capture it!
